try","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43404,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宗廉送明瓦屏风至次韵答之 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"小中虽异大中同，明处韬光暗处通。\n三直五横真本子，人间无路献重瞳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43405,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宗廉送明瓦屏风至次韵答之 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"瓦木铺排得此身，乾坤何物到头真。\n道人具得屏风眼，还向小斋来卜邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43406,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渡厓海","author":"陈献章","text":"争如天上弄银河，不使鸣榔乱我歌。\n有酒只邀王母醉，托身明月挂婆娑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43407,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题石泉","author":"陈献章","text":"蟹眼不绝西坡陀，涓流直下成江河。\n君钓石泉歌不得，江门渔父为君歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43408,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠宗兄汝学使广西还","author":"陈献章","text":"匹马行行西复东，一鞭腾破雪千重。\n寒梅初放一枝白，间破江南无数红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43409,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"承张方伯报旌表家慈贞节","author":"陈献章","text":"大喜来何处，劳公一札香。\n圣恩元浩荡，老母自冰霜。\n此报符佳梦，他时益大防。\n无论一家惠，举俗赖虞唐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43410,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旌表家慈书至 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"迢递来金阙，光辉动荜门。\n世知慈母节，人带圣君恩。\n笑喜翻疑梦，荣封却未言。\n痴儿何以报，忠孝策诸孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43411,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旌表家慈书至 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"荆扉无外事，散步数鸡孙。\n特地开双眼，从天降一言。\n江山同出色，存殁各沾恩。\n斟酌杯中酒，春风欲到门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43412,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中咏梅 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"去岁誇身健，寻梅到几山。\n酒倾崖影尽，衣染露香还。\n北斗今何向，南枝半已残。\n下堂儿女笑，老脚正蹒跚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43413,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中咏梅 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"孤山一片雪，千古独称奇。\n此外不能到，人间都未知。\n正嗟同赏绝，又过半閒时。\n回首西岩下，南枝映北枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43414,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中咏梅 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"人生如逝水，花发见南枝。\n对影身犹隔，闻香席不移。\n延缘看月久，勃窣下阶迟。\n坐恐芳时暮，扶衰了一枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43415,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中咏梅 其四","author":"陈献章","text":"何处梅梢月，流光到枕屏。\n江山都太极，花草亦平生。\n阁冷香难即，窗晴影似横。\n冻崖妨足蹇，藜杖意高撑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43416,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中咏梅 其五","author":"陈献章","text":"隐几日初下，东岩兴复饶。\n月高寒自照，花近夜相撩。\n浊酒频堪写，清弦岂易调。\n罗浮在何处，魂梦与逍遥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43417,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中咏梅 其六","author":"陈献章","text":"水陆花何限，梅花太绝尘。\n如何开眼处，不见赏花人。\n北坞风微动，南梢月自真。\n老夫前席坐，得意不无神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43418,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中咏梅 其七","author":"陈献章","text":"山阁数株梅，山翁手自栽。\n有花娱我老，无计避人开。\n色映书帷净，香寻墨沼来。\n庶几吾服汝，不作委蒿莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43419,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中咏梅 其八","author":"陈献章","text":"风月江山外，乾坤草木间。\n卷帘疏影动，拄颊暗香还。\n约伴多为地，吟诗别作坛。\n终南虽白阁，不恃小庐山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43420,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中咏梅 其九","author":"陈献章","text":"何处花堪忆，江门水背过。\n满身都著月，一片未随波。\n高倚松为盖，清连竹作窝。\n白鸥衔不去，飞入钓鱼蓑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43421,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中咏梅 其十","author":"陈献章","text":"借如桃有实，方朔不来偷。\n山近重重见，人无浅浅休。\n路经寒水断，香被白云留。\n寄语林和靖，江门是一丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43422,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陶佥宪约游厓山立张陆公祠","author":"陈献章","text":"西风吹桂楫，公泛两厓间。\n落日看碑过，中流掩袂还。\n迹留新栋宇，名落旧江山。\n二百馀年下，谁无一日閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43423,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游厓山次李九渊韵 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"前劫消磨尽，中原恨未沉。\n兴亡先有谶，秦贾竟何心。\n一一凭天地，劳劳笑古今。\n千秋厓石角，泛艇一来临。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":43424,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]